            <p class="subline" style="font-size:15px; margin-top:8px;">
              Six things we're actually good at — not a service menu padded out to look impressive.
            </p>
            <div class="grid grid--2" style="margin-top:18px; gap:40px; flex:1;">
              <div class="grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:12px; align-content:start;">
                <div class="card" style="padding:14px;">
                  <div class="card__icon" style="width:34px; height:34px; margin-bottom:8px;">
                    <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="width:17px;height:17px;"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M15 9l-3.5 1.5L10 14l3.5-1.5L15 9z"></path></svg>
                  </div>
                  <div class="card__title" style="font-size:14px;">Product Strategy & Discovery</div>
                  <div class="card__desc">UX audits, research, MVP scoping, roadmaps.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="card" style="padding:14px;">
                  <div class="card__icon" style="width:34px; height:34px; margin-bottom:8px;">
                    <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="width:17px;height:17px;"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="5" rx="1"></rect><rect x="4" y="11" width="16" height="5" rx="1"></rect><rect x="4" y="18" width="10" height="2" rx="1"></rect></svg>
                  </div>
                  <div class="card__title" style="font-size:14px;">UX / UI Design</div>
                  <div class="card__desc">Websites, apps, SaaS dashboards, enterprise UI, design systems.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="card" style="padding:14px;">
                  <div class="card__icon" style="width:34px; height:34px; margin-bottom:8px;">
                    <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="width:17px;height:17px;"><path d="M8 6l-5 6 5 6M16 6l5 6-5 6"></path></svg>
                  </div>
                  <div class="card__title" style="font-size:14px;">Web Design & Development</div>
                  <div class="card__desc">Sites, landing pages, e-commerce, performance & SEO.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="card" style="padding:14px;">
                  <div class="card__icon" style="width:34px; height:34px; margin-bottom:8px;">
                    <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="width:17px;height:17px;"><rect x="7" y="2" width="10" height="20" rx="2"></rect><line x1="11" y1="18" x2="13" y2="18"></line></svg>
                  </div>
                  <div class="card__title" style="font-size:14px;">Mobile Apps</div>
                  <div class="card__desc">iOS, Android, cross-platform, PWAs.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="card" style="padding:14px;">
                  <div class="card__icon" style="width:34px; height:34px; margin-bottom:8px;">
                    <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="width:17px;height:17px;"><rect x="8" y="8" width="8" height="8" rx="1"></rect><path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.5 4.5l3 3M16.5 16.5l3 3M19.5 4.5l-3 3M7.5 16.5l-3 3"></path></svg>
                  </div>
                  <div class="card__title" style="font-size:14px;">Product & Engineering</div>
                  <div class="card__desc">MVP builds, frontend, dev-handoff support.</div>
                </div>
