                  </div>
                  <div class="card__title" style="font-size:14px;">Branding & Growth</div>
                  <div class="card__desc">Identity, decks, marketing retainers.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="content-photo" style="align-self:stretch;">
                <img src="/images/deck/design-workspace2.jpg" alt="Studio workspace" />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="footer-strip">
            <span>uiedge.in</span>
            <span>admin@uiedge.in</span>
            <span class="footer-strip__num">03 / 16</span>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>

      <!-- ============================================================
           04 — Our Process
           ============================================================ -->
      <section class="slide-viewport">
        <article class="slide slide--dark">
          <div class="slide-inner">
            <p class="eyebrow">04 / Process</p>
            <h2 class="headline headline--lg">A system, not a freelancer.</h2>
            <p class="subline" style="font-size:15px; margin-top:10px;">
              Nine steps, each with a business reason attached — not just an activity to check off.
            </p>
            <div class="process-grid" style="margin-top:20px;">
              {[
                ["01", "Discovery", "Align on business goals before design."],
                ["02", "Research", "Understand real users, not assumptions."],
                ["03", "Strategy", "Decide what to build and why."],
                ["04", "Wireframing", "Structure before style — cheaper to change early."],
                ["05", "UI Design", "Premium, on-brand, conversion-focused screens."],
                ["06", "Prototype", "Test the experience before code."],
                ["07", "Testing", "Validate with real users, reduce risk."],
                ["08", "Dev Handoff", "Clean specs so build matches design."],
                ["09", "Optimization", "Measure and improve after launch."],
              ].map(([num, title, desc]) => (
                <div class="process-step">
                  <div class="process-step__num">{num}</div>
                  <div class="process-step__title">{title}</div>
                  <div class="process-step__desc">{desc}</div>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="footer-strip">
            <span>uiedge.in</span>
            <span>admin@uiedge.in</span>
            <span class="footer-strip__num">04 / 16</span>
