                  <strong style="color:var(--d-text);">Context.</strong> A boutique hospitality brand in Kerala
                  came to us with a five-year-old site that no longer matched the quality of the stay it was
                  selling.
                </p>
                <p class="body-copy" style="max-width:100%;">
                  <strong style="color:var(--d-text);">The challenge.</strong> Slow pages, a cluttered nine-item
                  nav, and a booking flow buried three clicks deep were costing them direct enquiries to OTAs.
                </p>
                <p class="body-copy" style="max-width:100%;">
                  <strong style="color:var(--d-text);">The goal.</strong> A faster, calmer site that earns trust in
                  the first scroll and gets a visitor to "enquire" in one clear path.
                </p>
                <p class="body-copy" style="max-width:100%;">
                  <strong style="color:var(--d-text);">Our approach.</strong> Cut the nav from nine items to five,
                  rebuilt the homepage around one hero decision, and moved booking to a persistent, single-step
                  call to action.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="content-photo" style="height:88px; margin-bottom:10px;">
                  <img src="/images/deck/hospitality.jpg" alt="Boutique hospitality property" />
                </div>
                <div class="browser-frame">
                  <div class="browser-frame__bar">
                    <span class="browser-frame__dot"></span><span class="browser-frame__dot"></span><span class="browser-frame__dot"></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="browser-frame__screen">
                    <div class="mock-nav">
                      <div class="mock-logo"></div>
                      <div class="mock-nav-links"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mock-hero"></div>
                    <div class="mock-row"><div class="mock-block"></div><div class="mock-block"></div><div class="mock-block"></div></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="margin-top:14px;">
                  <span class="callout">Nav simplified 9 → 5 items — faster decisions</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="footer-strip">
            <span>uiedge.in</span>
            <span>admin@uiedge.in</span>
            <span class="footer-strip__num">05 / 16</span>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>

      <!-- ============================================================
           06 — Case Study 1 · Solution & Outcome
           ============================================================ -->
      <section class="slide-viewport">
        <article class="slide">
          <div class="slide-inner">
            <p class="eyebrow">06 / Case Study — Hospitality</p>
            <h2 class="headline headline--md">Clean, fast, and built to convert.</h2>
            <div class="grid grid--2" style="margin-top:22px; gap:44px; flex:1; align-items:start;">
              <div>
                <div class="browser-frame">
                  <div class="browser-frame__bar">
                    <span class="browser-frame__dot"></span><span class="browser-frame__dot"></span><span class="browser-frame__dot"></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="browser-frame__screen">
                    <div class="mock-nav">
                      <div class="mock-logo"></div>
                      <div class="mock-nav-links"><span></span><span></span></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mock-hero"></div>
                    <div class="mock-row" style="margin-top:10px;"><div class="mock-block"></div><div class="mock-block"></div></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:14px;">
