                <p class="body-copy" style="max-width:100%;">
                  From an outdated, hard-to-trust site to a clean, fast, conversion-focused presence — loads in
                  under two seconds, fully responsive, accessible by default.
                </p>
                <div class="content-photo" style="height:130px; margin-top:16px;">
                  <img src="/images/deck/hospitality.jpg" alt="Boutique hospitality property" />
                </div>
                <div style="margin-top:16px; padding:18px 20px; border-radius:16px; border:1px solid var(--d-border); background:var(--d-surface);">
                  <p style="font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.6; color:var(--d-text-secondary); font-style:italic;">
