                    check in."
                  </p>
                  <p style="margin-top:8px; font-family:var(--d-font-label); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.04em; color:var(--d-text-muted); text-transform:uppercase;">
                    — Owner, Hospitality Client
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="footer-strip">
            <span>uiedge.in</span>
            <span>admin@uiedge.in</span>
            <span class="footer-strip__num">06 / 16</span>
