                </p>
                <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:20px;">
                  <span class="chip">Design system delivered</span>
                  <span class="chip">Dev handoff docs included</span>
                  <span class="chip">WCAG-checked</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="footer-strip">
            <span>uiedge.in</span>
            <span>admin@uiedge.in</span>
            <span class="footer-strip__num">08 / 16</span>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>

      <!-- ============================================================
           09 — Our Products · Veterinary Management Software
           ============================================================ -->
      <section class="slide-viewport">
        <article class="slide slide--dark">
          <div class="slide-inner">
            <p class="eyebrow">09 / Our Products</p>
            <h2 class="headline headline--md">A veterinary management platform, built and run by us.</h2>
            <div class="grid grid--2" style="margin-top:24px; gap:44px; flex:1; align-items:center;">
              <div>
                <p class="body-copy" style="max-width:100%;">
                  A single platform for clinics and independent vets to manage appointments, patient records,
